Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Tresor nei: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault verschlësselen: message schlëssel: key.
>> decrypted := vault entschlësselen: encrypted schlëssel: key.

Ausgab 
schreiwen: ['Message:'], nei-zeil
schreiwen: message, nei-zeil
schreiwen: ['Decrypted:'], nei-zeil
schreiwen: decrypted, nei-zeil.
